  "purpose": "Request independent production acceptance review of the successful bounded TASK-THINSLICE-001 deployment at https://abris.653915.com against exact deployed source 1021abf3bf82512292bfdc34103e8c3ef141a633, retained run and artifact evidence, public runtime behavior, security controls, and declared limitations.",
  "scope": [
    "Review exact canonical evidence source 3796cb37dac176c8d506451524fcf0744695ef42, the exact post-deployment documentation range from deployed source 1021abf3bf82512292bfdc34103e8c3ef141a633, and the included current deployment trust-surface files.",
