    "Review that the production workflow pinned the independently accepted product source and independently reviewed deployment trust surface through owner-controlled external anchors, protected main, exact-main CI, and fail-closed checks.",
    "Review AU-AGENT-003 post-production and publication-preservation dispositions without accepting their conclusions by default, and identify any unsupported status, evidence gap, security issue, or traceability conflict.",
