    "Preserve the explicit limitations for simultaneous global or multi-region convergence, long-duration stability, broader browsers and platforms, independent browser console/network capture, Prototype 9.1 scale, and all other previously excluded scope.",
    "Return decision VERIFIED only if the bounded production result is independently acceptable; otherwise return REWORK_REQUIRED with precise blocking evidence and required rework."
